{"seq":3,"slug":"arts-criticism","title":"艺术批评","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"艺术批评-简介\">艺术批评 简介</h1><p>艺术批评是连接艺术作品与公众理解的重要桥梁，通过系统的分析框架和独立的审美判断，赋予艺术创作以社会对话和文化阐释的深度。研究生阶段的艺术批评学习要求超越感性印象，掌握批评的历史脉络、方法工具和当代议题。</p>\n<p>本课程从批评基础理论出发，经由视觉艺术和表演艺术两大门类的专题批评实践，最终进入当代艺术批评的前沿议题，构建完整的批评能力框架。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>艺术批评基础</strong>追溯艺术批评从古典到现代的发展历程，介绍批评史上的重要人物和转折节点、审美判断的哲学基础和判断标准的演变，以及形式主义、图像学和社会学批评等主要方法论流派。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>视觉艺术批评</strong>将批评方法应用于具体的视觉艺术门类，分别讲解绘画与雕塑的形式分析和意涵解读方法、摄影批评中技术媒介与视觉叙事的关系，以及新媒体艺术给批评实践带来的新范式和新挑战。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>表演艺术批评</strong>聚焦时间性和身体性维度突出的艺术形式，探讨戏剧批评中文本、表演和舞台的多维度分析、音乐批评的听觉经验和结构分析方法，以及舞蹈批评中身体动作的描述和意义阐释。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>当代艺术批评</strong>关注全球化和多元文化语境下艺术批评面临的新议题，包括制度批评对美术馆和画廊权力结构的反思、身份政治在当代艺术创作和批评话语中的核心位置，以及全球化对艺术价值标准和批评视角的影响。</p>\n<p>建议学习者在阅读批评理论的同时大量阅读优秀的批评文本，批评写作能力的提升依赖于对作品的持续观看和对文字的反复锤炼。参观展览后主动撰写批评练习是非常有效的学习路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"艺术批评基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"criticism-history","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 批评史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/foundations/criticism-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aesthetic-judgment","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 审美判断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/foundations/aesthetic-judgment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"criticism-methodologies","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 批评方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/foundations/criticism-methodologies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"visual-arts","title":"视觉艺术批评","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/visual-arts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"painting-sculpture-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 绘画与雕塑批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/visual-arts/painting-sculpture-criticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"photography-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 摄影批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/visual-arts/photography-criticism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-media-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 新媒体批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/visual-arts/new-media-criticism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performing-arts","title":"表演艺术批评","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/performing-arts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theater-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 戏剧批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/performing-arts/theater-criticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"music-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 音乐批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/performing-arts/music-criticism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dance-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 舞蹈批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/performing-arts/dance-criticism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary","title":"当代艺术批评","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"institutional-critique","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 制度批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/contemporary/institutional-critique"},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-politics-art","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 身份政治与艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/contemporary/identity-politics-art"},{"seq":3,"slug":"globalization-art-criticism","title":"研究生 艺术批评 — 全球化与艺术批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/arts-criticism/contemporary/globalization-art-criticism"}]}]}